<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Winkelhaak lifts Dec qtr op income, output.</title>
<headline>Winkelhaak lifts Dec qtr op income, output.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Capital spending			  4.69 vs 2.69</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			 1,761 vs 1,715</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		327,000 vs 318,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     5.4 vs 5.4</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  54,100 vs 53,610</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     56,049 vs 54,978</p>
<p>Full name: Winkelhaak division of Evander Gold Mines Ltd, managed by Gencor Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company, which has merged with Kinross and Leslie in Evander Gold Mines Ltd, reported an operating income of 3.84 million rand from the 2.66 in the previous quarter.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
